flowchart TD
    U[Trader objective] --> MB[Morning Brief]
    MB --> SC[Setup Scanner]
    SC --> ES[Evidence Snapshot]
    ES --> NV[Night Vision replay]
    ES --> OT[Options Terminal]
    ES --> RA[Research Agent Fleet]

    MD[Alpaca SIP / IEX / OPRA] --> CORE[Read-only Python Core]
    CORE --> ES
    OI[Contract OI + OI date] --> CORE
    NEWS[Yahoo / SEC / Finviz context] --> RA

    RA --> MEM[Bounded research memo]
    NV --> DEC[Human research decision]
    OT --> DEC
    MEM --> DEC

    DEC --> PA[Paper Autopilot]
    PA -->|premarket watch only| PLAN[Immutable plan]
    PLAN -->|fresh closed RTH confirmation| PE[Shadow Executor]
    PE --> LEDGER[(SQLite audit ledgers)]
    PE -->|hard limits + simulated exits| PP[Paper Portfolios]
    LEDGER --> PP

    PP --> GATE[Prospective sample gates]
    GATE --> REVIEW[LIVE_REVIEW_REQUIRED]
    REVIEW -. no order authority .-> STOP[Human boundary]
